  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<table class=\"w-100 summary stripe-even\"><tbody><tr><th class=\"ve-col-4 ve-text-center\"><p>属性值加成</p></th><th class=\"ve-col-4 ve-text-center\"><p>体型</p></th><th class=\"ve-col-4 ve-text-center\"><p>速度</p></th></tr><tr><td class=\"ve-text-center\"><p>选择一项：</p><p>(a)选择一项属性+2;选择一项不同的属性+1 (b)选择三项不同的属性+1</p></td><td class=\"ve-text-center\"><p>中等</p></td><td class=\"ve-text-center\"><p>30尺</p></td></tr></tbody></table><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Creature Type\"><h3>生物类型 Creature Type。</h3><p> 你是类人生物。当任何效果的前提需要你是精灵时，你同时也被视作一位精灵。<br style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\"><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\">体型 Size。</strong> 你的体型为中等。<br style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\"><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\">速度 Speed。</strong> 你的步行速度为30尺。</p><p><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14.6667px;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\">语言 Languages</strong><br style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14.6667px;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\">你的角色能够说、读和写通用语和另一种你和 DM 认为适合该角色的语言。《玩家手册》提供了一项可供选择的泛用语言列表。DM 能自由地为特定战役从列表中去掉或增加语言。<br style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\"><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\">星界之火 Astral Fire。</strong> 你习得下列一项你选择的戏法：<em style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:medium;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\">舞光术Dacing Lights</em> 、 <em style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:medium;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\">光亮术Light</em> 、或 <em style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:medium;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\">圣火术Sacred Flame</em> 。你施展该戏法的施法属性为智力、感知、或魅力。（选择此种族的时候决定）。<br style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\"><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\">黑暗视觉 Darkvision。</strong> 在微光光照下，你身边60尺内可以视为等同于明亮光照。而在黑暗中，该范围内可视为等同于微光光照。你无法在黑暗中分辨颜色，只能看到有灰度的黑白画面。<br style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\"><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\">妖精血统 Fey Ancestry。</strong> 你进行的为避免魅惑状态或结束你身上的魅惑状态所做的豁免具有优势。<br style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\"><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\">敏锐感官 Keen Senses。</strong> 你拥有察觉技能的熟练项。<br style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\"><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\">星光步 Starlight Step。</strong> 使用一个附赠动作，你能魔法地传送到30尺内一处你可见且未被占据的空间里。你能使用本特质的次数与你的熟练加值相同，当你完成一次长休后，你恢复所有已使用的次数。<br style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\"><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\">星界出神 Astral Trance。</strong>你不需要睡眠，魔法效应亦无法使你陷入睡眠。你能花费4小时进行出神般的冥想来完成一次长休，且整个冥想过程中你都能保持清醒。<br style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\">当你完成出神时，你获得一个自选技能的熟练项，与一件自选武器或自选工具的熟练项（从《玩家手册》中选择它们）。你通过抽取共享的精灵记忆及星光位面的实体经历，神秘地获得了这些熟练，这个好处会一直持续到你完成下一次长休。</p></div><p>很久很久以前，一群精灵为了更加亲近他们的神，于是从妖精荒野迁徙到了星光位面。在银色虚空中生活使得神性之光的火花注入他们的灵魂之中。这种光芒以星状微光的形式显现在星界精灵的双眼当中。<br style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\">因为在星光位面之中所有的事物都不会老化，所以居住在该位面的星界精灵可能非常年长，而他们的长寿导致了他们对时间的流逝有一种非常独特的观感。有些精灵容易忧郁，而另一些精灵可能表现得缺乏感情。许多精灵都寻找着创造性的方法来让自己忙碌起来。无论他们选择生活在安静的沉思中，还是出发去探索多元宇宙的边界，星界精灵都倾向于用时间的角度去看待事物，然后觉得这些事物对他们来说只有一丁点的意义，有时甚至一点都没有。不居住在星界的星界精灵的能活超过750岁。</p><table class=\"w-100 summary stripe-even\"><tbody><tr><th class=\"ve-col-4 ve-text-center\"><p>Ability Scores</p></th><th class=\"ve-col-4 ve-text-center\"><p>Size</p></th><th class=\"ve-col-4 ve-text-center\"><p>Speed</p></th></tr><tr><td class=\"ve-text-center\"><p>Choose one of: (a) Choose any +2; choose any other +1 (b) Choose three different +1</p></td><td class=\"ve-text-center\"><p>Medium</p></td><td class=\"ve-text-center\"><p>30 ft.</p></td></tr></tbody></table><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Creature Type\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Creature Type.</span> You are a Humanoid. You are also considered an elf for any prerequisite or effect that requires you to be an elf.</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Astral Fire\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Astral Fire.</span> You know one of the following cantrips of your choice: @spell[dancing lights], @spell[light], or @spell[sacred flame]. Intelligence, Wisdom, or Charisma is your spellcasting ability for it (choose when you select this race).</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Darkvision\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Darkvision.</span> You can see in dim light within 60 feet of yourself as if it were bright light, and in darkness as if it were dim light. You discern colors in that darkness only as shades of gray.</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Fey Ancestry\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Fey Ancestry.</span> You have advantage on saving throws you make to avoid or end the &amp;Reference[condition=charmed] condition on yourself.</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Keen Senses\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Keen Senses.</span> You have proficiency in the &amp;Reference[skill=Perception] skill.</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Starlight Step\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Starlight Step.</span> As a bonus action, you can magically teleport up to 30 feet to an unoccupied space you can see. You can use this trait a number of times equal to your proficiency bonus, and you regain all expended uses when you finish a long rest.</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Astral Trance\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Astral Trance.</span> You don't need to sleep, and magic can't put you to sleep. You can finish a long rest in 4 hours if you spend those hours in a trancelike meditation, during which you remain conscious.</p><p>Whenever you finish this trance, you gain proficiency in one skill of your choice and with one weapon or tool of your choice, selected from the <span class=\"bold\">Player's Handbook</span>. You mystically acquire these proficiencies by drawing them from shared elven memory and the experiences of entities on the Astral Plane, and you retain them until you finish your next long rest.</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Languages\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Languages.</span> You can speak, read, and write Common and one other language that you and your DM agree is appropriate for your character.</p></div><p>Long ago, groups of elves ventured from the Feywild to the Astral Plane to be closer to their gods. Life in the Silver Void has imbued their souls with a spark of divine light. That light manifests as a starry gleam in an astral elf's eyes.</p><p>Because nothing ages on the Astral Plane, astral elves who inhabit that plane can be very old, and their longevity gives them an unusual perspective on the passage of time. Some are prone to melancholy, while others might display an absence of feeling. Many look for creative ways to occupy themselves. Whether they choose to live in quiet contemplation or strike out to explore the reaches of the multiverse, astral elves tend to see things through the lens of time as having little or no meaning to them. Astral elves who don't dwell on the Astral Plane can live to be more than 750 years old.</p>",
